      <h2 class="section__title">Success Story: Spanish Brand Optimizes with Morocco</h2>
      <p class="section__text">
        A Spanish-based fast fashion brand approached SDF Clothing in 2022 to optimize their supply chain for European markets. The brand produced casual wear and denim for the Spanish and broader European market but faced long lead times from Asian manufacturing, limiting their ability to respond to trends.
      </p>
      
      <h3 class="section__subtitle">The Challenge</h3>
      <p class="section__text">
        The brand needed faster replenishment to support their fast fashion business model. Their Asia production required 35-45 days production plus 30-40 days shipping, totaling 65-85 days from order to delivery. This lead time limited their ability to respond to emerging trends. They required consistent quality comparable to their existing production with lead times under 50 days total.
      </p>
      
      <h3 class="section__subtitle">The Solution</h3>
      <p class="section__text">
        SDF Clothing leveraged Morocco's proximity to Europe to reduce total lead time to 45 days (35 days production + 10 days shipping). We sourced fabrics from European suppliers, developed samples in 10 days, and accommodated their 400-piece MOQ across 3 styles with 6 sizes each. Our team communicated regularly via email and WhatsApp in Spanish and English, providing production updates. Morocco's duty-free EU access maintained cost advantages while significantly reducing lead time.
      </p>
      
      <h3 class="section__subtitle">The Result</h3>
      <p class="section__text">
        The brand transitioned 70% of their EU production to Morocco by 2023. Total lead time reduced from 75 days to 45 days - a 40% improvement. Initial quality inspection showed 98% pass rate - comparable to their Asia production. The faster lead time enabled the brand to introduce new collections 3 times per year instead of 2, significantly increasing revenue. By 2024, Morocco became their primary hub for EU markets.
      </p>
      
      <h3 class="section__subtitle">Key Takeaways</h3>
      <p class="section__text">
        This case demonstrates how Morocco manufacturing can support EU-focused fast fashion brands. Morocco's proximity to Europe and duty-free access provide significant lead time advantages without sacrificing quality or cost competitiveness. The brand improved market responsiveness by 40% while maintaining margins. The success led to expanding the product line to include dresses and blouses, all produced through Morocco operations.
